     After creating the app (see release/STORE_STEPS.md, section Yandex Mobile Ads) replace the three ad_*_id values
     with R-M-<appId>-1 / -2 / -3 and rebuild (tools/build_android.sh, bump versionCode).
     Debug builds always use the demo units; release with demo units explicitly: gradle assembleRelease -PadsDemo=true -->
